    "reason": "The plugin’s user-facing purpose is to add a remote-access authentication gate to the DeepSeek Harness Web UI: it injects a login page for non-loopback access and wraps most `/api` RPC routes with session validation, while providing related auth endpoints for login, logout, status, and password operations. Evidence in the README also explicitly notes operational limits (notably, websocket event streams remain ungated)."
